      "message": "No, errno isn\u0027t a thing that goes across the dbus response anyhow. \n\nWhen an error only has an errno, it devolves into a System.Error.*. The earlier commit in this stack migrated most previously SdBusError into a generated exception type so that this code would rarely trigger anymore anyhow, but if it were manually constructed by a client then line 294 triggers with the same effect at an on-the-wire level. Detailed analysis to confirm if you are interested:\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/williamspatrick/4273180f6e6ccc4f3665303fded9e3a3",
